<title>NORWAY: Deutsche Bank sold stake in Sysdeco.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank sold stake in Sysdeco.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sysdeco ASA said on Friday that Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and its parent, Deutsche Bank AG, had sold their 47.4 percent holdings in the Norwegian software company.</p>
</text>
